Sorry, I should have asked for the plot from:

ezDesign(
    data = tldAgg
    , x = condition
    , y = ID
    , rows = SesNum

    , cols = Session
)

Which might make it easier to see (i.e. putting the between variable as a faceting variable rather on the x-axis).

You could also do:

for(s in unique(tldAGG$SesNum)){
    temp = tldAgg[tldAGG$SesNum==s,]
    temp$ID = factor(temp$ID)
    d = as.data.frame(with(temp,table(condition,ID,Session))
    print(d[d$Freq==0,])
}

--
Mike Lawrence
Graduate Student
Department of Psychology & Neuroscience
Dalhousie University

~ Certainty is (possibly) folly ~

