Yup, your design was set up to counter-balance session type and session number, which is good to do, but you can't then add session number as a within predictor. You can keep session type (and condition) as a within and put group (songs first vs speech first) as a between factor, and that will answer whether the ordering of the sessions mattered. This is pretty standard.

